{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/380cd0729eaa9f1e897aff02d311d7b6.webp?t=1776011602\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/380cd0729eaa9f1e897aff02d311d7b6.poster.avif?t=1776011602\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Snap things and Grab em!\" width=1170 height=295 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New York, 1987.</strong> Enter Nifty Nevada: the world\u2019s most famous fashion photographer. Glamorous and glittering, her globe-hopping career has given her the perfect cover for her real passion - stealing everything in sight. With the help of her loyal and very professional henchmen, Nifty uses her photography skills to plan the most daring heists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite her perfect alibi, Nifty has attracted the attention of one Detective Rio Rivers, the hardest working officer at Interpol. An unstoppable instrument of justice, Rio has been doggedly pursuing Nifty\u2019s every move for months, and she knows that at any moment the evidence she needs to finally break the case will come to light! Any day now. In the meantime, it\u2019d be nice if Nifty stopped looking at her with her beautiful eyes! There\u2019s crime behind that stunning smile, and Rio knows it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/831cdb65d7acc1e90467b393b9312682.webp?t=1776011602\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/831cdb65d7acc1e90467b393b9312682.poster.avif?t=1776011602\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Gameplay\" width=1170 height=305 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Nifty, you\u2019ll travel to exclusive and exotic locations to scout out the most valuable targets. Swipe anything and everything; the world is your very stealable oyster! Use your camera to take photos of treasures, threats, opportunities, and danger, then use those photos to assemble the plan for your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/5d329ecbd5e85c3faa032a7bee88c9b5.poster.avif?t=1776011602\" aria-label=\"Gameplay footage of using the camera, then a second clip of building a heist plan.\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/5d329ecbd5e85c3faa032a7bee88c9b5.webm?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/5d329ecbd5e85c3faa032a7bee88c9b5.mp4?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what surprises might pop up! Your henchmen are definitely top tier, and not some random crime guys, so whatever happens is probably not their fault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/2c552cd42ae0e903a71b819c7a7e03d3.poster.avif?t=1776011602\" aria-label=\"Gameplay footage of one henchmen crushing a guard under a chandelier, then a second clip of a henchmen smashing an ice statue to pieces.\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/2c552cd42ae0e903a71b819c7a7e03d3.webm?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/2c552cd42ae0e903a71b819c7a7e03d3.mp4?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve secured the goods, bring them home to your brand new luxury apartment. Turn this place into your own personal museum with anything you please - stolen paintings, statues, pets, even robot butlers! You know, rich people stuff. Everyone is going to be so jealous of your cool things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/8f0bb7cd901fe8a16d625d0995ab4d2a.poster.avif?t=1776011602\" aria-label=\"Gameplay footage of customizing the apartment, then a second clip of walking through a decorated space.\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/8f0bb7cd901fe8a16d625d0995ab4d2a.webm?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/8f0bb7cd901fe8a16d625d0995ab4d2a.mp4?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/39eafa0938293a8fe8ffc31c4473c1a8.poster.avif?t=1776011602\" aria-label=\"Your Crew\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/39eafa0938293a8fe8ffc31c4473c1a8.webm?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/39eafa0938293a8fe8ffc31c4473c1a8.mp4?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world's greater fashion photographer-slash-criminal mastermind spares no expense when it comes to assembling a crew. Whether it's brains, brawn, style, or silky soft fur, Nifty will need all of their talents to pull off the perfect heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/c652815c5072a47befb8479ae90fe492.avif?t=1776011602\" alt=\"Five potential henchmen are shown: a cat, a buff guy, an old lady with a wrench, a socialite, and a mysterious figure in robes. There is a 6th image of a question mark.\" width=1200 height=812 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nifty starts off with Brick Hammer and The Conversationalist in <strong>Snap &amp; Grab: Episode 1 - The Penthouse,</strong> but that's just the start for her crew! Grow your team with a brilliant and uniquely skilled new crew member in every episode.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/729e9fb425521838674d534b2d0ee5f9.poster.avif?t=1776011602\" aria-label=\"Locales\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/729e9fb425521838674d534b2d0ee5f9.webm?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/729e9fb425521838674d534b2d0ee5f9.mp4?t=1776011602\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nifty\u2019s quest for the ultimate riches spans five action-packed episodes, and will take you all around the globe to the most fabulous parties and events fit to rob. Will you take all the fish from the Artquarium, or all the art? Both? Will the elusive Heart of Glass be too much to handle in the disappearing Ice Hotel of Giza? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start the story on April 24th with <strong>Snap &amp; Grab</strong>:\u00a0<strong>Episode 1 - Erik Pop's Apartment</strong>, then tune in through the rest of 2026 as the next four episodes lead Nifty and her crew around the world as they attempt to complete the world's most lavish and ridiculous heists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/f6b7f2dce981b6e116627f83ac336ab4.avif?t=1776011602\" alt=\"Screenshots of two additional levels, the Kyoto Fashion Train and the Artquarium of the Pacific.\" width=1200 height=441 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/extras/680b76f495b663d64f2c907c435b9604.avif?t=1776011602\" alt=\"Screenshots of two additional levels, Mayan Future Expo and the Ice Hotel of Giza.\" width=1200 height=441 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/897160?t=1776011602","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/d0da98c35e5625e449e96596b4bc1f6d21c5fa7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776011602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/5e0c415dbc6aeee080dc84237a74b086876f3232/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776011602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/897160/5e0c415dbc6aeee080dc84237a74b086876f3232/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776011602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},